{"id": "c1", "kind": "doc", "text": "루프를 더 오래 돌리는 것 자체는 제품이 아니라 드리프트를 키운다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "docs/product/foundations/loop-engineering-principles-and-pitfalls.md:61", "quote": "Longer loops without better state usually create larger drift. The product is\nrecoverable work, not background motion."}]}
{"id": "c2", "kind": "doc", "text": "채팅에만 있는 계획은 다음 에이전트가 잃어버린다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "docs/product/foundations/loop-engineering-principles-and-pitfalls.md:65", "quote": "\nIf a route, todo, gate, lesson, or priority only exists in chat, the next agent\nwill eventually lose it. Important plans should become typed todos, gates,"}]}
{"id": "c3", "kind": "doc", "text": "관측은 전이가 아니고 provider 영수증은 커널이 커밋하기 전까지 진행이 아니다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "docs/architecture.md:92", "quote": "An observation is not a transition, and a provider receipt is not accepted\nprogress until the capability validates it and the Kernel commits the resulting\nstate change. Domain state, evidence, and receipts are artifacts exchanged"}]}
{"id": "c4", "kind": "code", "text": "기본 실행 프로파일의 outcome floor 임계는 표면 성과 3연속이다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/execution_profile.py:18", "quote": "    \"outcome_floor\": {\n        \"required_when\": \"after_surface_progress_streak\",\n        \"surface_streak_threshold\": 3,"}]}
{"id": "c5", "kind": "code", "text": "기본 실행 프로파일의 outcome_markers 와 surface_only_hints 는 빈 리스트다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/execution_profile.py:21", "quote": "        \"outcome_markers\": [],\n        \"surface_only_hints\": [],"}]}
{"id": "c6", "kind": "code", "text": "작은 배치 연속 임계는 2다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/execution_profile.py:31", "quote": "    \"degradation_policy\": {\n        \"small_scale_streak_threshold\": 2,\n        \"on_degradation\": \"require_blocker_or_expand_next_batch\","}]}
{"id": "c7", "kind": "code", "text": "성과가 저하되면 최소 규모를 올린 계약이 중국어로 주입된다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/control_plane/handoff/delivery_contract.py:122", "quote": "    instruction = compact_packet_text(\n        \"下一轮回到 active state P0/P1 outcome 做 audit，\"\n        f\"选连贯段，至少 {_contract_minimum_text(minimum_scale)}；\"\n        f\"{floor_sentence}\"\n        f\"含真实 {_contract_must_include_text(must_include)}；\"\n        \"禁止 isolated test/surface-only propagation；\"\n        \"若只能小步/表面，blocker，不 spend。\","}]}
{"id": "c8", "kind": "code", "text": "직전 턴이 준비 전용이면 다음 턴의 의무가 문자열로 못박힌다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/control_plane/work_items/outcome_followthrough.py:57", "quote": "        \"latest_delivery_turn_kind\": delivery_turn_kind,\n        \"obligation\": \"advance_primary_outcome_or_write_blocker\",\n        \"accepted_resolution_kinds\": [\n            DeliveryTurnKind.PRODUCT_PATH_EXECUTION.value,"}]}
{"id": "c9", "kind": "code", "text": "제어 평면은 결정론적이고 Claude Code 의 /goal 을 쓰지 않는다. 런타임은 네이티브 /loop 이고 훅은 기본 설치가 아니다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/claude_goal_mode/hooks/goal_policy.py:4", "quote": "In the native-`/loop` design, Claude Code's `/loop` is the runtime and loopx's\nMCP `should_run` is the per-tick gate. This hook is NOT installed by default"}]}
{"id": "c10", "kind": "code", "text": ".claude/loop.md 프로토콜이 추론으로 성공을 선언하지 말라고 지시한다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/claude_goal_mode/scripts/goalmode_cmd.py:71", "quote": "        f\"2. If should_run=true: `claim_task` the next open todo, do ONE bounded segment,\\n\"\n        f\"   then VERIFY it with a real check (build/test) — never claim success from\\n\"\n        f\"   reasoning — and `complete_task(..., agent_id=\\\"{agent_id}\\\", evidence=\\\"<ran + result>\\\")`.\\n\"\n        f\"3. Stay within the goal's scope; do not start initiatives outside the todos.\\n\""}]}
{"id": "c11", "kind": "code", "text": "should_run 프로브가 안 뜨면 비읽기 툴을 fail-closed 로 거부한다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/claude_goal_mode/hooks/goal_policy.py:183", "quote": "        # deterministic should_run probe unavailable -> fail closed (non-read-only tool)\n        return d(\"deny\", \"loopx should_run probe unavailable — failing closed under goal-mode\")"}]}
{"id": "c12", "kind": "code", "text": "Task 는 읽기 전용 허용 목록에서 일부러 빠져 있다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/claude_goal_mode/hooks/goal_policy.py:57", "quote": "# NOTE: `Task` is deliberately NOT here. It can launch a subagent that performs\n# writes, so allowing it unconditionally would bypass the gate when\n# should_run=false. It must go through the gate: denied when should_run=false,\n# otherwise deferred to Claude Code's normal permission flow (unknown tool)."}]}
{"id": "c13", "kind": "code", "text": "Bash 는 write_scope 가 아니라 문자열 denylist 로만 막힌다는 한계를 스스로 적는다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/claude_goal_mode/hooks/goal_policy.py:15", "quote": "Limitation (by design): Bash is gated only by a denylist, so a determined shell\ncommand can still write outside write_scope or reach the network. For STRONG\nisolation (untrusted code / unattended high-stakes), run Claude Code inside a dev\ncontainer or VM, which contains the whole process at the environment level."}]}
{"id": "c14", "kind": "code", "text": "action signature 의 두 해시가 다르면 CONTRACT_ERROR 다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/control_plane/turn_driver/driver.py:65", "quote": "    if (\n        signature.get(\"matches\") is not True\n        or not source_hash\n        or source_hash != envelope_hash\n    ):\n        return LoopXTurnRoute.CONTRACT_ERROR"}]}
{"id": "c15", "kind": "code", "text": "세션 재개는 goal_id·agent_id·todo_id 가 정확히 같아야 허용된다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "loopx/control_plane/turn_driver/driver.py:181", "quote": "    identity_fields = (\"goal_id\", \"agent_id\", \"todo_id\")\n    actual = {field: str(binding.get(field) or \"\") for field in identity_fields}\n    expected = {field: lineage[field] for field in identity_fields}\n    if actual != expected:"}]}
