{"id": "c23", "kind": "doc", "text": "서버 이전에 writer 정확성을 확보하는 것이 로드맵 1번이다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "docs/architecture.md:260", "quote": "1. **Writer correctness before a server**: make existing CLI writers safe under\n   concurrency with per-goal locks, idempotency keys, and optimistic revision\n   checks. `todo`, `refresh-state`, reward writeback, quota spend, and history"}]}
{"id": "c24", "kind": "doc", "text": "200시간은 wall-clock 이고 연속 모델 실행이 아니다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "README.md:92", "quote": "not 200 hours of continuous model execution or a claim of unattended\nproduction autonomy. Open each visual to inspect the public-safe graph,\nevidence branches, and decisions preserved across turns."}]}
