{"id": "c26", "kind": "doc", "text": "ACP 페어 실행 두 건이 paired_no_score_uplift 로 기록됐다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "docs/research/long-horizon-agent-benchmarks/benchmark-closeout-failure-attribution-20260620.md:47", "quote": "| `skillsbench@1.1` | `llm-prefix-cache-replay` | BenchFlow ACP blind-loop baseline/treatment | `0.0/0.0`, `paired_no_score_uplift` | `paired_zero_acp_blind_loop_non_native_goal_no_uplift` | Stop using more ACP blind-loop repeats as primary Codex Goal evidence; implement a native SkillsBench app-server Goal worker first. |\n| `skillsbench@1.1` | `tictoc-unnecessary-abort-detection` | BenchFlow ACP blind-loop baseline/treatment | `0.0/0.0`, `paired_no_score_uplift` | `paired_zero_acp_blind_loop_non_native_goal_no_uplift` | Keep as a stability canary only until the native SkillsBench app-server Goal worker exists. |"}]}
{"id": "c27", "kind": "doc", "text": "ACP 행은 non-native 정책 아래 setup/prewarm/round/scoring 만 증명한다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "docs/research/long-horizon-agent-benchmarks/benchmark-closeout-failure-attribution-20260620.md:62", "quote": "app-server Goal case. The ACP rows still prove only setup/prewarm/round/scoring\nunder a non-native blind-loop policy, while the marker-completion native"}]}
