{"id": "c29", "kind": "doc", "text": "저빈도 회귀는 릴리스나 큰 제어 평면 변경 때 의도적으로 돌린다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "regression/README.md:3", "quote": "This directory is for low-frequency behavior regressions that check how Goal\nHarness CLI contracts are consumed by worker/executor surfaces.\n\nFast deterministic examples stay under `examples/`. Files here may exercise\nreal local tools such as Codex CLI when explicitly requested, so they should be\nrun deliberately during release or major control-plane changes."}]}
{"id": "c30", "kind": "doc", "text": "모든 변경은 codex/ 브랜치의 전용 clean worktree 에서 한다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "AGENTS.md:7", "quote": "For any tracked repository change beyond a trivial typo fix, create or use a\ndedicated clean `git worktree` on a `codex/` branch from latest `origin/main`\nbefore editing files. Do not implement changes directly in a dirty primary\nworktree, even when the task starts by inspecting that dirty tree."}]}
{"id": "c31", "kind": "doc", "text": "자기 병합 전에 canary premerge 로 위험 기반 검증셋을 돌려야 한다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "AGENTS.md:77", "quote": "Before self-merging non-trivial LoopX changes, run\n`loopx canary premerge --from-git-diff` or an equivalent risk-based validation\nset. The PR comment must name the changed surfaces, checks run, failures/skips,\nmanual holds, and why the coverage is enough. One hand-picked smoke is not\nenough for runtime, quota/status, scheduler, todo, install, dashboard,\nbenchmark-boundary, or public/private evidence changes."}]}
{"id": "c32", "kind": "doc", "text": "outcome_markers 를 채운 execution_profile 예시가 통합 가이드에 있다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "huangruiteng/loopx@v0.4.2 (c94e188) 기준", "evidence": [{"source": "lx", "locator": "docs/integration.md:136", "quote": "    \"outcome_floor\": {\n      \"required_when\": \"after_surface_progress_streak\",\n      \"surface_streak_threshold\": 3,\n      \"outcome_markers\": [\n        \"eval_metric\",\n        \"experiment\",\n        \"macro_evidence\",\n        \"evidence_segment\",\n        \"adapter_proof\"\n      ],\n      \"surface_only_hints\": [\n        \"forecast\",\n        \"runbook\","}]}
